{"4088520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MeowFactory", "steam_appid": 4088520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the MEOWFACTORY!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near and depressing future, when the world is on the verge of destruction, ONLY THEY can revive production!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Yes, yes, ONLY MEOWORKERS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/f4823e9413b75d41d675511e9581dda6.poster.avif?t=1787106317\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/f4823e9413b75d41d675511e9581dda6.webm?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/f4823e9413b75d41d675511e9581dda6.mp4?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build magnificent factories to meet the needs of laazy hoomans!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And don’t forget — when your meoworkers only have paws, hammies are tough to handle.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/084cfa65c54704ed42b2b37682578600.poster.avif?t=1787106317\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/084cfa65c54704ed42b2b37682578600.webm?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/084cfa65c54704ed42b2b37682578600.mp4?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Automate production lines and manage limited space to achieve perfection. Connect machines with conveyor lines and minimize hand (well, paw) labour!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Oh, also keep an eye on your fluffy conveyor belt riders and pull them away before they stick their curious noses into machines!</i>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/44c92fe9d1cb41e0879a235c6c1189bd.poster.avif?t=1787106317\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/44c92fe9d1cb41e0879a235c6c1189bd.webm?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/44c92fe9d1cb41e0879a235c6c1189bd.mp4?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a full production cycle to maximize product variety for your customers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And make sure your fluffy employees don't gobble up everything along the way!</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/b4514c4cf04faa2eee3af66f2a4f70dd.avif?t=1787106317\" width=780 height=392 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather a team of professionals! Look after their mood, cleanliness, and find the right place for each of them!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Otherwise, these cats will blow up, puke on, or burn down everything you've built, or at the very least turn your nice and tidy factory into a branch of cat hell.</i><br><br>And break the record for the number of days without accidents! <br><i>It will be EXTREMELY DIFFICULT.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this awaits you at the MEOWFACTORY!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the MEOWFACTORY!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near and depressing future, when the world is on the verge of destruction, ONLY THEY can revive production!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Yes, yes, ONLY MEOWORKERS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/f4823e9413b75d41d675511e9581dda6.poster.avif?t=1787106317\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/f4823e9413b75d41d675511e9581dda6.webm?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/f4823e9413b75d41d675511e9581dda6.mp4?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build magnificent factories to meet the needs of laazy hoomans!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And don’t forget — when your meoworkers only have paws, hammies are tough to handle.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/084cfa65c54704ed42b2b37682578600.poster.avif?t=1787106317\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/084cfa65c54704ed42b2b37682578600.webm?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/084cfa65c54704ed42b2b37682578600.mp4?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Automate production lines and manage limited space to achieve perfection. Connect machines with conveyor lines and minimize hand (well, paw) labour!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Oh, also keep an eye on your fluffy conveyor belt riders and pull them away before they stick their curious noses into machines!</i>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/44c92fe9d1cb41e0879a235c6c1189bd.poster.avif?t=1787106317\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/44c92fe9d1cb41e0879a235c6c1189bd.webm?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/44c92fe9d1cb41e0879a235c6c1189bd.mp4?t=1787106317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a full production cycle to maximize product variety for your customers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And make sure your fluffy employees don't gobble up everything along the way!</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088520/extras/b4514c4cf04faa2eee3af66f2a4f70dd.avif?t=1787106317\" width=780 height=392 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather a team of professionals! Look after their mood, cleanliness, and find the right place for each of them!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Otherwise, these cats will blow up, puke on, or burn down everything you've built, or at the very least turn your nice and tidy factory into a branch of cat hell.</i><br><br>And break the record for the number of days without accidents! <br><i>It will be EXTREMELY DIFFICULT.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this awaits you at the MEOWFACTORY!</p>", "short_description": "Welcome to the MEOWFACTORY! Automate production lines and manage limited space to achieve perfection. Connect machines with conveyor lines and minimize hand (well, paw) labour! In the near and depressing future, when the world is on the verge of destruction, ONLY MEOWORKERS can revive production!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Russian<strong>*</st